{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/57160df8b165cff90de5353645a9728b.avif?t=1772214907\" width=618 height=110 /></span>Build your very own mechanical keyboard empire, from soldering PCB and repairing switches to building custom mechanical keyboards for demanding clients to become the ultimate mechanical keyboard builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/a81ee5cb74d979714757f4112960c8f3.poster.avif?t=1772214907\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/a81ee5cb74d979714757f4112960c8f3.webm?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/a81ee5cb74d979714757f4112960c8f3.mp4?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/448cf8684b6a0ec2eaf47a00b82b062b.avif?t=1772214907\" width=618 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Keyboard Building Simulator invites you to explore a vast collection of real-world components from manufacturers in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without the risk of breaking your bank account, what extraordinary mechanical keyboard would you bring to life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/d99b2ec4467234cfde98e614b80f4071.poster.avif?t=1772214907\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/d99b2ec4467234cfde98e614b80f4071.webm?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/d99b2ec4467234cfde98e614b80f4071.mp4?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/f6dbc83926655ea06bfe887bf1c48cfb.avif?t=1772214907\" width=618 height=110 /></span>Are you intimidated by the idea of building your own mechanical keyboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Keyboard Building Simulator is designed to empower even the most inexperienced keyboard enthusiasts, providing step-by-step instructions on assembling components in the correct order. Discover valuable insights about each part, its purpose, and gain the confidence to bring your dream keyboard to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/eade8657f9f8eed594ac137a5f2484d8.poster.avif?t=1772214907\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/eade8657f9f8eed594ac137a5f2484d8.webm?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392900/extras/eade8657f9f8eed594ac137a5f2484d8.mp4?t=1772214907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2392900?t=1772214907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/